Goal:
  + (FALSE)
  - (and (at robot-3 cell-12-10) (nothing-is-moving))
Pred prop:
  + (NOT-free cell): in_init in_pre
  - (at robot cell): in_init in_pre in_goal in_eff
  + (at robot cell): in_init in_pre in_goal
  - (free cell): in_init in_pre in_eff
Func prop:
  - (step-cost): in_init init_all_nonneg init_all_nonpos init_all_int on_num_op_rhs write_delta_nonneg write_delta_nonneg_int
  - (total-cost): in_init init_all_nonneg init_all_nonpos init_all_int in_metric is_metric_alone in_eff rhs_funcs:(go-cost step-cost stop-cost) write_delta_nonneg write_delta_nonneg_int
  + (total-cost): in_init init_all_nonneg init_all_nonpos init_all_int in_metric is_metric_alone in_eff rhs_funcs:(go-cost stop-cost) write_delta_nonneg write_delta_nonneg_int
